{"kind": "mod", "id": 1371, "name": "Environment Replace", "slug": "environment-replace", "teaser": "Replace the background and splash screen", "owner_name": "Devraccoon", "downloads": 5692, "favourites": 4, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "GNU GPLv3", "guid": "com.hazelify.environmentreplace", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Scripting", "category_id": 3, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T06:34:37.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-04-29T23:10:46.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-04-29T23:10:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.0", "latest_version": "1.6.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/gpl-3.0/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3><strong>CHECK INSTALL TAB FOR REQUIRED DEPENDENCY!</strong></h3>\n<p>Replace splash screen: put videos (mp4, gif) or pictures (jpeg, png, webp, etc.) into the “splash” folder.</p>\n<p>Every game restart will have a randomly selected splash screen.</p>\n<p>The video volume can be adjusted in the BepInEx <strong>F12</strong> menu in-game.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/kgEvv1s.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kgEvv1s.png\" alt=\"kgEvv1s.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>Replace environment: put videos (mp4, gif) or pictures (jpeg, png, webp, etc.) into the “environment” folder.</p>\n<p>Every game restart will have a randomly selected wallpaper.</p>\n<p>(Download the above image <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_A2S2NwDAwhfYfAjEWSOl--VUOFd7tnX/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a>)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-con